# Compiler output trees. Each is ~15 MB and every one is fully reproducible from
# p4/case_a_defense3_fixed_ack_delay.p4 plus the bf-p4c invocation documented in
# REPORT.md §13, so they are NOT tracked -- 113 MB of regenerable output is not an
# artifact worth carrying. What IS evidence is kept, small, under artifacts/:
#   artifacts/assembly/*.bfa                 the compiled stateful-ALU assembly
#   artifacts/resources/*.table_summary.log  the compiler's own resource reports
# `python3 analysis/assert_salu_asm.py` re-checks the archived assembly with no
# arguments, so the REPORT §7 evidence stays verifiable without them.
p4/build_*/
p4/bx_*/
*.compile.log
